  headerText: Color Picker
  contentText: 'The color picker lets you change color of the characters skin, gear,
    weapon, backpack and shield. Some items have preset colors in order to perserv
    multicolored objects with details (example a brown weapon stock with a light
    gray barrel), changing the color of these items might give you a bad result,
    use with caution. '
