  contentText: "When enabled, the generated spritesheet will include a slash animation
    baked directly into it. \n\nYou can cycle between different slash styles and
    pick one you like. You can adjust the color of it with the color picker.\n\nWhen
    disabled, the slash effect will be excluded from the output, allowing you to
    use your own custom or third-party slash in-game.\n\nNote: This option is enabled
    by default."
