  headerText: Gunfire Integration
  contentText: 'When enabled, the generated spritesheet will include the gunfire
    animation baked directly into it. Additionally, it will create four extra spritesheets
    for the following actions while firing: Run, Strafe Left, Strafe Right, and Run
    Backwards.


    When disabled, the gunfire effect will be excluded from the
    output, allowing you to use your own custom or third-party muzzle flash in-game.


    Note:
    This option is enabled by default.'
  warningText: 
  delayBeforeShow: 0.5
  fadeDuration: 0.2
