  headerText: Dynamic outline
  contentText: "When enabled, your character will receive a soft, 1\u2011pixel border
    that subtly picks up the colour of the nearest sprite pixels and lightens them.
    Instead of a harsh black stroke, each outline pixel samples its neighbour\u2019s
    hue and shifts it toward white, creating a gentle, integrated glow that helps
    your sprite stand out without clashing with its own palette."
  warningText: 
  delayBeforeShow: 0.5
  fadeDuration: 0.2
