    spritesheets. \n\n16-bit: this sets the output resolution of each sprite to 64x64
    pixels. Great for a more old-school look!\n\nHD: This is the default resolution.
    This sets the output resolution of each sprite to 128x128 pixels."
  warningText: 
  delayBeforeShow: 0.5
  fadeDuration: 0.2
